{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/path-cli/src/projection/copilot.rs","issuer":"mailto:1240090+bdelanghe@users.noreply.github.com","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-15T18:25:10.606929Z","id":"02583de7580c52a61802994b76cfb2f05390a71a26b19f7b6b2c231ca6b316d0","body":{"detail":"Round robin: claude, codex and pi keep the source session id through every hop; copilot -> * returns a new id (a1539809..., 87c5973f..., ...). If copilot accepts an arbitrary UUID as a session id, reuse view.id as the other projectors do; if not, record the mapping in meta so the identity is recoverable. review/roundrobin.md, 2026-10-15.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":6},"end":{"line":6},"content_hash":"d39eb5434060b5d941878a6b9f77e819e87052ced17a47dd41b47547b884662d"},"summary":"a copilot projection always mints a fresh session id, so copilot is the one hop that loses the session identity","tags":["review","roundtrip","defect-candidate","session:claude-code:7c8ae6d3-afd1-4605-913b-9fd31e45468f"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/path-cli/src/projection/codex.rs","issuer":"mailto:1240090+bdelanghe@users.noreply.github.com","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-19T17:18:22.561920Z","id":"369140c010d565fa6ea0891145128451e73d803f19aba2562acd5ef654fc8475","body":{"detail":"Known defect, pinned by crates/path-cli/tests/codex_home_copy.rs (snapshot codex_home_copy__rollout_path). Codex resumes by appending to threads.rollout_path; the row names the rollout under the CODEX_HOME it was written in, so a cell copy, backup or another machine's home appends to the original (resume matrix 2026-10-15: v2 codex cell 33 -> 93 lines). The other agents' resume targets carry no such indirection: claude/pi/copilot/gemini files and the opencode/cursor databases are self-contained under their home.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":133},"end":{"line":133},"content_hash":"c156f82116be64939c03287ed1c7c2e1915f5fc09c8d62fd5dfe5acb77327cdf"},"suggested_fix":"Write the path relative to CODEX_HOME if codex accepts it, else re-register the row when a home is copied (a path verb), and accept the snapshot diff.","summary":"threads.rollout_path is absolute: a copied CODEX_HOME still appends to the original rollout","tags":["known-defect","append-after-turn","session:claude-code:729d6bb8-59f0-4ddf-892e-603372433260"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/path-cli/src/projection/gemini.rs","issuer":"mailto:1240090+bdelanghe@users.noreply.github.com","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-19T17:24:16.874767Z","id":"33770bc9f6892d6166d34654bd3dd9e7e7e28c5be77b3598940915ec3d6ea7d9","body":{"detail":"gemini-cli 0.47.0 loads the projected history (4/4 cells drawn), but no run has produced a complete model answer to pin: Login-with-Google is refused for individuals (moved to Antigravity), and the API-key run recorded by webmock (codex -> gemini) got 429 on pro twice and a flash stream cut without finishReason at 218 s. The request body is pinned (cassettes/gemini); the response is not. Closes with a key that has quota: record one complete exchange and replay it.","kind":"concern","summary":"resume into gemini-cli is unpinned: no answered model turn has been recorded","tags":["declared-limit","unpinned","session:claude-code:729d6bb8-59f0-4ddf-892e-603372433260"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/path-cli/src/projection/cursor.rs","issuer":"mailto:1240090+bdelanghe@users.noreply.github.com","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-19T17:24:16.891995Z","id":"d997d42792eba2459ddf7dba222871565630be50c34c73565157650fd16a2fe6","body":{"detail":"cursor <workspace> opens the Agents window and adopts the projected composer heads (4/4 listed by title, Allie AX read), but with no deeplink to a composer and agent mode off the body is never rendered, so there is nothing to compare. cursor-agent is a different store toolpath neither derives nor projects. Closes with a composer deeplink or an AX read of an opened composer.","kind":"concern","summary":"resume into Cursor.app is unpinned: the transcript body is never shown","tags":["declared-limit","unpinned","session:claude-code:729d6bb8-59f0-4ddf-892e-603372433260"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/path-cli/src/projection/cursor.rs","issuer":"mailto:1240090+bdelanghe@users.noreply.github.com","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-19T18:18:40.135394Z","id":"4849d73649e6cda51af12cb21e2b16d312521b6f592c6046b59b85c834dd8ca0","body":{"detail":"Projection now upserts a composerHeaders row when the table exists and still writes the legacy ItemTable key, which Cursor 3.24.12 was seen to migrate and list (resume matrix v4, 2026-10-15). Whether Cursor accepts a row toolpath wrote directly (columns derived from the head: workspaceId, recency = lastUpdatedAt) has not been run against Cursor.app.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":215},"end":{"line":215},"content_hash":"4af180e73ebdb6c7db9eebdfb6445775e60b69d29dcffa1ace8f04cd25ae9304"},"summary":"The composerHeaders table row the projection writes is not yet checked against a live Cursor 3.24","tags":["cursor","pr/20","declared-limit","session:claude-code:729d6bb8-59f0-4ddf-892e-603372433260"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/path-cli/src/projection/cursor.rs","issuer":"mailto:1240090+bdelanghe@users.noreply.github.com","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-19T21:29:10.329669Z","id":"2e5b6947247bf24676d0179b165eda84a787609c21c270ef8a4abd438da05eac","body":{"detail":"Projection now upserts a composerHeaders row when the table exists and still writes the legacy ItemTable key, which Cursor 3.24.12 was seen to migrate and list (resume matrix v4, 2026-10-15). Whether Cursor accepts a row toolpath wrote directly (columns derived from the head: workspaceId, recency = lastUpdatedAt) has not been run against Cursor.app.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":223},"end":{"line":223},"content_hash":"4af180e73ebdb6c7db9eebdfb6445775e60b69d29dcffa1ace8f04cd25ae9304"},"summary":"The composerHeaders table row the projection writes is not yet checked against a live Cursor 3.24","supersedes":"4849d73649e6cda51af12cb21e2b16d312521b6f592c6046b59b85c834dd8ca0","tags":["cursor","pr/20","declared-limit","session:claude-code:729d6bb8-59f0-4ddf-892e-603372433260"]}}
